{"event_id": "7", "type": "speak", "sender": "3", "sender_name": "X-9", "sender_role": "AlienRobot", "content": {"text": "我提出一个假设：醉酒男人关掉的灯是交通信号灯或铁路信号灯，导致远处发生交通事故，造成人员死亡。"}, "references": [{"event_id": "5", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "1", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "3", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "4", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "6", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "2", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}], "tags": ["信号系统", "死亡原因", "醉酒行为", "因果假设", "环境因素", "逻辑推理", "交通管理", "责任归属", "事故机制"], "metadata": {"agent_expertise": ["logic", "probability"]}, "timestamp": "2026-01-11T20:08:59.526309+00:00"}
