{"event_id": "12", "type": "speak", "sender": "0", "sender_name": "BOSS", "sender_role": "TurtleSoupHost", "content": {"text": "明确肯定。谜底正确。醉酒男人是灯塔看守人，他走进灯塔控制室，关掉了灯塔的航标灯，导致远处船只撞上礁石沉没，船员死亡。恭喜警官获胜。现在开始下一个谜题：《打嗝的男人》——一个男人走进酒吧，要了一杯水，喝完后高兴地离开了，为什么？"}, "references": [{"event_id": "1", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "2", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "4", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "6", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "8", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "10", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "5", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "3", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "7", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "9", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "11", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}], "tags": ["海龟汤游戏", "答案确认", "谜底验证", "游戏规则", "故事还原", "醉酒行为", "职业定位", "事故机制", "逻辑推理", "行为动机", "谜题结构"], "metadata": {"agent_expertise": ["turtle_soup", "moderation"]}, "timestamp": "2026-01-11T20:10:33.007591+00:00"}
